  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Changing lives through music</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sonidos Para La Vida is a non-profit organization dedicated to transforming the lives of children and young people in Guatemala through the practice of a musical instrument. The more than 800 children and youth in our program are away from gangs, leisure, and many harmful activities, all because they learn the passion for something good in their lives and, with it, achieve all its benefits. When you help Sonidos Para La Vida, you are helping to change the life of one more child in Guatemala.</narrative>
  </description>
